    "result_text": "The full suite is green: **68 tests run, 0 failures, 0 errors, BUILD SUCCESS**.\n\n## Summary\n\nI implemented the `ownerSegment` field on the owner resource, following the repo's existing derived-field conventions.\n\n**`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 added a read-only `ownerSegment` property to the `Owner` schema (the DTO is generated from this spec), documenting the `<TIER>_<AREA>` format and its four possible values.\n\n**`src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 added a MapStruct `@Mapping` for `ownerSegment` plus an `ownerSegment(Owner)` helper that:\n- Resolves the effective membership level the same way the existing `membershipLevel` mapping does (stored value, else computed), yielding `PREMIUM` when it's \u2265 3, otherwise `STANDARD`.\n- Uses the existing `OwnerLocality.of(city, postcode)` to derive the region, mapping a known region (NSW/VIC/QLD) to `METRO` and anything else to `REGIONAL`.\n\nThe new `Cp55Tests` pass and no existing tests regressed.",
